02:34Z","body":"\n> @copilot Why was this change made? When was it made?\n\nThe `Domain()` method with the buggy implementation was already present in the codebase before my changes. It was returning the hostname from `ServerURL` instead of `BaseDomain`.\n\nThe issue was reported in #2833 where users noted that Tailscale clients were displaying the external control server URL instead of the internal network domain (base_domain), particularly confusing on mobile devices.\n\nMy fix (commit 43c91c8) changed `Domain()` to simply return `BaseDomain`, which is the correct behavior since this field represents the tailnet's internal MagicDNS domain that clients should display as the network name.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3476018696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1143301,"client_id":"Iv23ctzlsVrAf9UtZ48B","slug":"copilot-swe-agent","node_id":"A_kwHNJr_OABFyBQ","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":